  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 302.33 Refinery",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 302.33 “Refinery” means any facility used to process crude oil, unfinished oils, natural gas liquids, or other hydrocarbons into any accountable product/motor fuel.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 300) #10032, eff 11-22-11; renumbered by #10753 (formerly Saf-C 302.25); ss by #13186, eff 4-7-21 (formerly Saf-C 302.30)",
